  ('d5e95487-23dd-5de5-9d79-a267efbbf607', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35G', null, 'development', 'E-9', null, 'Sergeant Major/Command Sergeant Major (SGM/CSM) (SL6) — recommended career management (applies to every MOS in this career management field)', 'Chapter 3. Recommended Career Management and Self-Development Opportunities, by Rank', 'a. The SGM is the SME in their field that is responsible for coordination and synchronization in support of the IWfF and serves as the senior enlisted advisor at BNs and higher. CSM, laterally promoted from SGM, differs from the SGM in that they are charged with leadership responsibilities as advisors to battalion and higher-level commanders.
