e. Seeking opportunities to learn and succeed is encouraged. These include competing in Soldier-of-the-Month Boards, earning the Expert Soldier Badge (ESB), volunteering for duties/details, and completing correspondence courses.
f. Corporal is the first NCO rank. Corporals will receive DA Form 2166-9-1a Support Forms IAW AR 623-3 for counseling and to begin familiarization with the evaluation process. It is recommended that Corporals improve their knowledge and practice of the Leadership Requirements Model and AR/DA PAM 623-3.', 'ba590b56856f0927ddc03e7a99f5ac39657a49da6c470272c6c01809fdd65acf', 1, 2, null, 18, null, null, false, null),
