(2) Operational: • JQS/R • STT • ATN - Training and Evaluation Outlines for Individual/Collective/Common Tasks • MOS STP Operational Critical Tasks • MITS • NCOPD
(3) Self-Development. Seeking continuous development in this domain, immaterial of concentration/major and within ones’ own personal and professional interests, is strongly encouraged to bridge gaps between the other education/training domains.', 'eac90a110f5ab1949861e77fd80802b6a84944d95861c31a1612483147bd084a', 7, 8, null, 64, null, null, false, null),
  ('17fa1538-8a91-5db4-b578-e90511f811f4', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35F', null, 'skills', 'E-6', null, 'SSG - Intelligence Sergeant (SL3) — Skills', 'Chapter 4. Military Occupational Specialty 35F, Intelligence Analyst', 'In addition to performing duties in the preceding skill level, the Intelligence Sergeant leads and trains Soldiers through subordinate NCOs. The Intelligence Sergeant coordinates the development of intelligence products, intelligence support to the targeting process, and the IA plan. Furthermore, the 35F SSG develops the information collection plan supporting tools and all source intelligence training.', '53706e10bbaa589f71176a019a8ef864d6b9fbb8fbc1b14b4bf5ed1834163888', 8, 8, null, 65, null, null, false, null),
  ('c47a1c53-5bb6-574b-8cf6-1648d3dcd6a9', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35F', null, 'assignments', 'E-6', null, 'SSG - Intelligence Sergeant (SL3) — KD Assignments', 'Chapter 4. Military Occupational Specialty 35F, Intelligence Analyst', 'The SSG should serve as a Squad Leader or NCOIC for a minimum of 24 months. NCOIC is an additional duty that is not listed as a principal duty title within CMF
35. NCOIC duties must be reflected on the rated Soldier’s NCOER to receive credit as KD time. Soldiers serving in a KD position commensurate to the next higher rank (consecutively or non- consecutively) will receive credit towards their KD requirement, providing that this captured time has been documented on the rated Soldier’s NCOER. Only service as a SSG will be counted towards the 24-month requirement. Service as a SGT (E5) does not count toward the 24-month requirement. • NCOIC • Squad Leader', '5f2afac2cbc1a4d67052621945f473d09cce4effe78057a8851ef4c0ec66a03b', 8, 8, null, 66, null, null, false, null),
  ('8aeccc5f-8feb-5e7e-b349-439e68208602', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35F', null, 'assignments', 'E-6', null, 'SSG - Intelligence Sergeant (SL3) — Operating Assignments', 'Chapter 4. Military Occupational Specialty 35F, Intelligence Analyst', '• Intelligence SGT • Collection Manager • Targeting Analyst • Security Manager • Operations Sergeant', 'ad2774df9afdf3b2a73243ac87802088e3e39164f6e32550f52f0f81f9206eed', 8, 8, null, 67, null, null, false, null),
