  ('ca451452-9c15-59ab-a76b-3bdd72bd8ff6', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35G', null, 'training', 'E-7', null, 'SFC - Senior GEOINT Imagery Sergeant (SL4) — Military Training/Education by Domain', 'Chapter 6. MOS 35G, Geospatial Intelligence (GEOINT) Imagery Analyst', 'Courses listed here are not all encompassing but illustrate a snapshot of opportunities that can be pursued to add depth and breadth to the knowledge and skills of the SL4 Soldier. Seeking additional training and education, beyond what is listed here, is highly recommended and will differentiate Soldiers from their peers. It is recommended that Soldiers refer to Chapter 3 of this document, the Foundry Course Catalog, the COOL/ArmyIgnitED website, and the ACT website, at a minimum, for developmental opportunities.
(1) Institutional (*When AGR can attend based on assignment): • SLC • Battle Staff Course* • Foundry Training • Joint Targeting School • ICPC • TMO Course • EJPME II • EOA Course • Ranger School* • Basic Airborne Course* • Jumpmaster Course* • Air Assault School* • SMU OTC
