35. NCOIC duties must be reflected on the rated Soldier’s NCOER to receive credit as KD time. Soldiers serving in a KD position commensurate to the next higher rank (consecutively or non- consecutively) will receive credit towards their KD requirement, providing that this captured time has been documented on the rated Soldier’s NCOER. Only service as a SSG will be counted towards the 24-month requirement. Service as a SGT (E5) does not count toward the 24-month requirement. • Squad Leader • NCOIC', '136ea1967e323e296cdadfa266cd80c80d19ee400eeb698fcd9e5b3b400b6b81', 31, 31, null, 149, null, null, false, null),
