  ('dd66e376-c55c-5b34-91b5-15188c02566d', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35S', null, 'skills', 'E-7', null, 'SFC – Senior Signals Collection/Exploitation Sergeant (SL4) — Skills', 'Chapter 16. MOS 35S, Signals Collector/Exploitation Analyst', 'Performs duties shown in preceding skill level; leads, plans tactical and strategic TechSIGINT and COMINT operations. Develops training certification programs, validates SIGINT dataflow, reviews mission management documentation, publishes technical findings of SOIs, and releases collection tasking in support of SIGINT information needs and requirements at echelon.', '64e9b7d46f23ef226e4691281c15a98d6160ca65f50632d67bb0be25c598e3a4', 42, 42, null, 195, null, null, false, null),
