  ('fa04c2f2-12d6-5ca6-840a-f329d46f1eb1', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35T', null, 'skills', 'E-5', null, 'SGT – MI Systems MAINT/INTGR (SL2) — Skills', 'Chapter 18. MOS 35T, MI Systems Maintainer (MAINT)/Integrator (INTGR)', 'In addition to performing duties in the preceding SL, the SL2 MI Systems MAINT/INTGR trains and provides purpose, motivation, and direction to subordinate Soldiers. Furthermore, they lead the integration of aerial and ground intelligence systems into an IA. They also lead shop operations.', '20b62b61064c702a386d5a175e47585a82ea59a638743604495fd1db16219153', 45, 45, null, 206, null, null, false, null),
