  ('75c8c957-e1fa-5bbd-bb5c-3004e0516753', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35T', null, 'skills', 'E-6', null, 'SSG - MI Systems MAINT/INTGR Sergeant (SL3) — Skills', 'Chapter 18. MOS 35T, MI Systems Maintainer (MAINT)/Integrator (INTGR)', 'In addition to performing duties in the preceding SL, the SL3 MI Systems MAINT/INTGR coach, counsel, and mentor subordinate NCOs. They also manage the integration of aerial and ground intelligence systems into an IA. Additionally, they manage shop operations and the technical training and certification program for the 35Ts within their unit.', '61ff3418c9fac79cb5beb1b2680ac78e9f6d96b3a60bdf95e572016da30db1c6', 45, 45, null, 211, null, null, false, null),
  ('a1c81075-a30b-5fc9-a631-01ae1c4ca211', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35T', null, 'assignments', 'E-6', null, 'SSG - MI Systems MAINT/INTGR Sergeant (SL3) — KD Assignments', 'Chapter 18. MOS 35T, MI Systems Maintainer (MAINT)/Integrator (INTGR)', 'The SSG should serve as a Squad Leader or NCOIC for a minimum of 24 months. NCOIC is an additional duty that is not listed as a principal duty title within CMF
35. NCOIC duties must be reflected on the rated Soldier’s NCOER to receive credit as KD time. Soldiers serving in a KD position commensurate to the next higher rank (consecutively or non- consecutively) will receive credit towards their KD requirement, providing that this captured time has been documented on the rated Soldier’s NCOER. Only service as a SSG will be counted towards the 24-month requirement. Service as a SGT (E5) does not count toward the 24-month requirement: • Squad Leader • NCOIC', '75c16c03aa9d552da244473223c14e96174b47c0391f66ecbc9a7322f0de2206', 46, 46, null, 212, null, null, false, null),
