  ('cb0f4aa3-a1d7-5bc1-8c26-d6469750649e', '1396060f-5555-5ed7-a918-43972de6ad68', 'Army', 'enlisted', '35T', null, 'training', 'E-7', null, 'SFC – Senior MI Systems MAINT/INTGR (SL4) — Military Training/Education by Domain', 'Chapter 18. MOS 35T, MI Systems Maintainer (MAINT)/Integrator (INTGR)', 'Courses listed here are not all encompassing but illustrate a snapshot of opportunities that can be pursued to add depth and breadth to the knowledge and skills of the SL4 Soldier. Seeking additional training and education, beyond what is listed here, is highly recommended and will differentiate Soldiers from their peers. It is recommended that Soldiers refer to Chapter 3 of this document, the Foundry Course Catalog, the COOL/ArmyIgnitED website, and the ACT website, at a minimum, for developmental opportunities.
